# libFuzzer dictionary for fuzz_deserialize (AFL/libFuzzer -dict= format).
#
# The three newer wire envelopes (crates/t-boost-core/src/serialize.rs) are gated
# behind a 4-byte magic prefix that a decoder rejects immediately if absent. Without a
# hint, the mutator would need to blindly guess one of these exact 4-byte sequences
# (1 in ~4 billion per attempt) before ever reaching the real decode logic beneath the
# prefix check. Seeding them here lets libFuzzer insert/splice the tokens directly.
"TBMC"
"TBTM"
"TBMT"
